sequenceDiagram
  actor Admin
  participant Browser
  participant Flask
  participant Recognizer
  participant Database
  Admin->>Browser: Select session and capture face
  Browser->>Flask: POST image with CSRF token
  Flask->>Database: Validate open session
  Flask->>Recognizer: Decode and detect exactly one face
  Recognizer-->>Flask: 128D embedding or error
  Flask->>Database: Read consenting cohort templates
  Flask->>Flask: Decrypt and compare distances
  alt Confident match
    Flask->>Database: Insert unique attendance and audit
    Database-->>Flask: Commit or duplicate conflict
    Flask-->>Browser: Recorded or already present
  else Unknown or ambiguous
    Flask-->>Browser: Rejected with manual attendance option
  end
